@startuml
' UC16 - Xem chi tiết Lesson
autonumber "<b>0.</b> "
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor white
skinparam LifeLineBackgroundColor white
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor black
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor black
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam MaxMessageSize 200

' AS-IS evidence; paths are relative to the workspace root.
' Scope: an authenticated Instructor selects a Lesson in an already loaded Course Builder.
' UC/BR sources: docs/uml/docs/LearnUP_UseCase.docx (UC16) and
' docs/uml/docs/LearnUP_QuyTacNghiepVu.docx (BR-79, BR-99, BR-292).
' Both documents have core revision 1, without an identified business release version.
' docs/source-of-truth is absent; the documents were relocated from the requested docs/ paths.
' UI: frontend/src/pages/instructor/course.builder.lesson.detail.tsx:274.
' Display: same file:66 (MaterialRow), :112 (InstructorLessonBody), :303 (error Alert).
' Route: frontend/src/router.tsx:457 and :481; Instructor-protected Builder child.
' Query lifecycle: frontend/src/hooks/use.api.query.ts:33.
' Wrapper: frontend/src/services/course.service.ts:115; imports courseAxios at :1.
' Transport: frontend/src/services/axios.customize.ts:47, :61 and :64.
' URL: frontend/src/config/env.ts:13; frontend/.env.development:10 = http://localhost:8080.
' Vite development mode is selected by frontend/package.json:7; frontend/vite.config.ts:12 loads env.
' No frontend .env/.env.local/.env.development.local or process URL overrides were found.
' Gateway: gateway/api-gateway/src/main/resources/application.yml:2 and :40.
' Trusted context: gateway/api-gateway/src/main/java/com/learnup/gateway/filter/JwtAuthenticationFilter.java:133.
' Bootstrap: services/course-service/src/main.ts:40 (api prefix and URI version 1).
' Controller: services/course-service/src/modules/courses/courses.controller.ts:144.
' Service: services/course-service/src/modules/courses/courses.service.ts:803.
' Repository: services/course-service/src/modules/courses/courses.repository.ts:723.
' Prisma wiring: services/course-service/src/infrastructure/prisma/prisma.service.ts:10.
' Models: services/course-service/prisma/schema.prisma:18, :31, :67, :84, :104 and :126.
' Local Course DATABASE_URL selects course_db; credentials are intentionally omitted.
' Runtime server reachability and deployment-mode overrides have not been verified.

actor Instructor
boundary "Lesson Detail Page" as Screen
participant ":ApiGateway" as Gateway
participant ":CoursesController" as Controller
participant ":CoursesService" as Service
participant ":CoursesRepository" as Repository
database "course_db" as CourseDB

' JWT authentication is a precondition; routine middleware and token refresh are omitted.
' The parent Builder structure is already loaded; UC15 preparation is outside this view.
' LayoutInstructorCourse also refetches assignments on pathname changes (:65).
' That Assessment request serves the shared outline, not this Lesson detail response;
' it is omitted from the selected UC16 interaction, not claimed to be absent from the page.

activate Instructor
Instructor -> Screen: Open Lesson details\n/instructor/courses/{courseId}/builder/lessons/{lessonId}
activate Screen
Screen -> Gateway: GET /api/v1/courses/{courseId}/lessons/{lessonId}
activate Gateway
Gateway -> Controller: GET /api/v1/courses/{courseId}/lessons/{lessonId}\nTrusted userId, organizationId, role
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: findLessonDetail(user, courseId, lessonId)
activate Service
Service -> Service: Verify Instructor and organization context
activate Service
deactivate Service

alt Access checked successfully
  ' findFirst requires lesson.id and Lesson.organizationId, then Module.courseId,
  ' Module.organizationId, Course.organizationId and Course.chain.instructorId.
  ' Materials and MediaFile metadata are reached through relations, with no separate
  ' organizationId predicates on those two nested selections.
  ' No Published-only filter or rejection for Locked, Submitted or disabled content.
  Service -> Repository: findLessonDetail(courseId, lessonId, organizationId, userId)
  activate Repository
  Repository -> CourseDB: Read assigned Lesson and material metadata\nCurrent organization and instructor
  activate CourseDB
  ' Prisma lesson.findFirst selects module/course metadata and ordered materials.
  ' Material ordering is position ASC; files are metadata only, not file downloads.
  CourseDB -->> Repository: Lesson with materials, or no match
  deactivate CourseDB
  Repository -->> Service: Scoped Lesson result
  deactivate Repository

  alt Lesson found successfully
    ' lesson.required = materials.some(material.isRequired), derived for display.
    ' It is not a persisted Lesson flag or a requirement on introductory content.
    ' course.locked derives solely from lockedAt; status is returned separately.
    ' sizeBytes is converted to string; no storage URL is produced or resolved.
    Service -->> Controller: Lesson details and material metadata
    deactivate Service
    Controller -->> Gateway: 200 OK - Lesson details
    deactivate Controller
    Gateway -->> Screen: Lesson details and material metadata
    deactivate Gateway
    Screen -->> Instructor: Show introduction, materials and status\nUse empty placeholders when needed
  else Lesson lookup failed
    ' Restore the same incoming executions closed by the preceding alternative.
    activate Gateway
    activate Controller
    activate Service
    ' Missing Lesson, mismatched Course, other tenant or another chain owner all
    ' produce the same 404; no successful detail response or downstream call follows.
    Service -->> Controller: Lesson not found
    deactivate Service
    Controller -->> Gateway: 404 Not Found
    deactivate Controller
    Gateway -->> Screen: Lesson load error
    deactivate Gateway
    Screen -->> Instructor: Show load error and Try again
  end
else Access check failed
  activate Gateway
  activate Controller
  activate Service
  ' A non-Instructor or missing organizationId is rejected before any DB read.
  Service -->> Controller: Access denied
  deactivate Service
  Controller -->> Gateway: 403 Forbidden
  deactivate Controller
  Gateway -->> Screen: Lesson load error
  deactivate Gateway
  Screen -->> Instructor: Show load error and Try again
end
deactivate Screen
deactivate Instructor

' Display includes Lesson title/content/position, Module identity/position, Course
' name/status/locked, derived required state, material counts/types and file metadata.
' Disabled materials, non-Ready files and released files are retained and tagged.
' Blank introduction and an empty material array are valid successful detail results.
' LessonMarkdown is a shared rendering component, not the Learner detail screen;
' it sanitizes Markdown. Any content-dependent HTTPS image loading is outside this
' metadata interaction; the backend makes no provider call to read this Lesson.
' BR-79: access is scoped to the current CourseChain instructor and organization.
' BR-292: introductory content is separate from Material; no completion, certificate
' or duration calculation is executed by this read operation.
' BR-99 limitation: this page shows Locked/Disabled badges but no detailed lock
' reason, and its Edit Lesson Content navigation is unconditional.
' It never calls content-editability. That endpoint/checkLessonContentAccess and
' its LearningClient completion lookup belong to the content-edit screen, not UC16.
' No storage provider, TenantClient, LearningClient, Kafka, writes or Learner progress.
' Framework UUID validation (400), transport failures and DB errors are omitted
' as technical failures with the same load-error UI; only business failures expand.
' Error transport caveat: axios.customize.ts:37 resolves HTTP error bodies; the page
' throws a plain Error when data is missing (:286). useApiQuery -> toApiError then
' maps that Error to status 0, so the page's specialized status-404 Alert is not
' reached through this normal Course HTTP-error path. The diagram shows generic UI.
' Aborted requests are ignored by useApiQuery; Try again reloads the same query.
@enduml
